The files in patches/ modify ninfer (https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and contain portions of it as context. tools/graft_dflash2.py imports
ninfer's artifact tools at run time.

The DFlash2 drafter rounds follow the mathematics of the Flash Next DFlash2 implementation in Infernix
(https://github.com/Wallawalla47/Infernix, Apache License 2.0), as does the idea of choosing the number of
verified drafts from the drafter's probabilities. The prompt-lookup rounds follow an idea from cinference
(https://github.com/satellitedown/cinference, Apache License 2.0).

No model weights are distributed with this repository. scripts/install-cuda.sh downloads NVIDIA CUDA
redistributable archives from NVIDIA; they are covered by NVIDIA's own licence.
